Title: "Specify"
Id: "cd988809-1ad1-40c0-979a-4dee01ecfb6c"

Text: "Top-level `Specify:` groups collect numeric-domain metadata items.

```mlg-fragment
Specify:
. positive:
  int:
  is: \"positive integer\"
. negative:
  decimal:
  is: \"negative decimal\"
Id: \"23e4567e-e89b-42d3-a456-426614174000\"
```

`Specify:` does not take a bracket heading and must contain at least one nested specify item."
Id: "248de633-e39c-4d35-8847-8d700256f881"
